# A space comes back scrolled where it was left (16 Nov 2026): scrolled up so the open tab was below
# the list, a switch to another space and back scrolled the list down to that tab again, as if it had
# just been opened (CraCore ActiveRowReveal). A tab picked in the space still comes into view.
# Dated ahead so Tab Cleanup leaves the Today tabs in place.
budget rss=700 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
